  "真实按弦近照：指尖按在琴枕与第一根品丝之间，靠近品丝。": "Real fretting close-up: a fingertip presses between the nut and first fret, close to the fret wire.",
  "观察指尖与品丝的距离。图中琴头在右侧；照片以古典吉他演示，单音按弦的位置同样适用于电吉他。": "Notice the distance between fingertip and fret. The headstock is on the right. This photo uses a classical guitar; the same single-note finger placement applies to electric guitar.",
