  "电吉他结构示意，标出琴头、琴颈、拾音器、琴桥、旋钮和输出。": "Electric guitar diagram showing headstock, neck, pickups, bridge, controls, and output.",
  "电吉他先把弦的振动变成电信号，再让放大系统把声音送出来。不插线也能听到一点琴弦声；接上音箱，才更容易听到它的音色。": "An electric guitar turns string vibration into an electrical signal, then a sound system makes it audible. You can still hear the strings unplugged; an amp lets you explore the guitar’s tone.",
  "琴头与弦钮": "Headstock & tuners",
  "琴颈与品丝": "Neck & frets",
