  "音量与音色旋钮": "Volume & tone knobs",
  "输出插孔": "Output jack",
  "弦钮用来调节琴弦张力，从而调音。粗弦是第 6 弦，细弦是第 1 弦；先记住标准调弦 E A D G B E。": "Tuners change string tension to tune the guitar. The thickest string is 6 and the thinnest is 1. Standard tuning, thick to thin, is E A D G B E.",
  "认识你的电吉他": "Meet your electric guitar",
  "点部件名称，看看它负责什么。": "Choose a part to see what it does.",
  "电吉他": "Guitar",
  "乐器线": "Instrument cable",
  "吉他音箱 INPUT": "Guitar amp INPUT",
  "一体式吉他音箱把前级、功率放大和喇叭装在一起。前级塑造音色，后级把信号放大，喇叭把它变成你听到的声音。": "A combo guitar amp puts a preamp, power amp, and speaker in one cabinet. The preamp shapes the tone, the power amp drives the speaker, and the speaker produces the sound.",
  "连接前先把音量调低并关机，插好乐器线，再按设备说明开机、慢慢加音量。先选 Clean 清音和小增益，听清声音后再尝试失真。": "Turn the volume down and power off before connecting. Plug in the instrument cable, then follow the device manual to power on and raise the volume gradually. Start with Clean and low gain before exploring distortion.",
  "器材外观示例。照片：": "Equipment example. Photo: ",
